# Crisp 6: one potato crisp of the snack bowl, a thin wavy oval about 8 cm long, centred on the origin and lying flat. It is a part
# of its own so the story capture can toss it; the snack bowl puts it in the heap. crisp_1 to crisp_6 are the bowl's six, each a little
# different in size and in how it waves.
format 1

Material material=home_crisp
    Distort amount=0.003 frequency=65
        Ellipsoid radii=(0.04, 0.006, 0.033)
